OL,3,GNEWSAReform selects Robert Jenrick to
OL,4,Afight to keep seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FMP Robert Jenrick has been reselected
OL,7,Fas Reform UK's candidate for the Newark
OL,8,Fseat in the next general election.
OL,10,FJenrick had represented the
OL,11,FNottinghamshire constituency as a
OL,12,FConservative MP from 2014, before
OL,13,Fjoining Reform in January this year.
OL,15,FThere had been recent speculation that
OL,16,FJenrick would attempt to move to
OL,17,Fanother seat for the next election,
OL,18,Falthough he had previously said he
OL,19,Fintended to stand again in Newark.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
