OL,3,GNEWSAReform selects Robert Jenrick to
OL,4,Afight to keep seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Friday, Reform's shadow chancellor
OL,7,Fconfirmed he had been reselected by his
OL,8,Fparty to fight to keep his seat.
